<source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-8ea7d680676d826fEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-23cf913557710f95END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_Alchemy_ElixirArcaneCultivation</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_Alchemy_ElixirArcaneCultivation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_Alchemy_ElixirArcaneCultivation\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">158155a6-c633-4917-94cd-ef4cd9487716</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:158155a6-c633-4917-94cd-ef4cd9487716\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:158155a6-c633-4917-94cd-ef4cd9487716\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Defiled_Temple\" title=\"Defiled Temple\">Defiled Temple</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;386&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;4</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/25px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/38px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/50px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Withers'\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/25px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\">Withers'</a> room at the <a href=\"/wiki/Epilogue\" title=\"Epilogue\">Epilogue Party</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[Though the book is mildewed and covered with what seems to be imprints of animal guts, one recipe in particular is still legible.]\n</p><p><br>\nThere is joy in helping others that I never knew. While I myself have never had any talent for manipulating the weave directly, I cannot get the look of wonder on Nikros' face out of my head, that look he had when he imbued this potion. It fills my body with a soothing electricity I had thought impossible.\n</p><p><br>\nRECIPE for 1 Elixir of Arcane Cultivation\n</p><p><br>\nExtracts needed:\n</p><p>- Vitriol of Weavemoss\n</p><p>- Sublimate of Belladonna\n</p><p><br>\nMethod:\n</p><p>In small doses, add the sublimate to the weavemoss vitriol, being careful to mix thoroughly until both extracts are seamlessly combined. Shudder on a low fire or leave inn the sun until the arcane energy becomes tangible.\n</p><p><br>\n[The last paragraph has been encircled thrice, once in blood.]\n</p><p><br>\nAs always:\n</p><p>When in doubt with alchemy\n</p><p>Just recall the rule of three\n</p><p>Thrice the same ingredient\n</p><p>Forms an extract excellent\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203151\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.069 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2229/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 40263/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13688/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 991556/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   57.331      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   57.331      1 -total\n 41.39%   23.732      1 Template:PageSeo\n 41.26%   23.657      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 40.72%   23.343      8 Template:Icon_text\n 38.76%   22.220     25 Template:Trim\n 29.75%   17.054      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n 17.62%   10.100      1 Template:Item_icon\n 17.16%    9.841      2 Template:Uid\n 10.16%    5.824      2 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:32028-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203151 and revision id 401980. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}